  effect: You no longer have a passive hp regen. Insteed every 0.5 seconds either
    heal 1 hp or take 1 dmg. This effect cannot kill you. Your passive hp regen bonuses
    insteed affect how much your hp goes up or down. (fully affects healing, half
    effects damaging).
  buff: Max HP + 20%(+20%)
  debuff: '-'
  effectSum: Instead of having a passive regen, randomly gain or lose 1 HP each half
    second. This counts as healing and taking damage.
  buffSum: 'Max HP + '
  debuffSum: '-'
  flavor: Thankfully this implant, implants itself so you don't need to get a doctor
    to do it for you!, just make sure you read the 200 page user manual or else it
    could go VERY wrong.
